// Vertex functions (V1): Shaders/Wave.slang lifts a sphere by params.x and waves it by params.y.
// Still (vertex_still), lifted 1.5 m (vertex_lifted; picked where it is now), waving at two
// moments (vertex_wave_a / _b differ), and lifted but past its vertexDistance (vertex_far: as still).
// Both of those wait for the GI's probes to settle (the sphere and floor were just made).
